ype":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103639","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103639","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103639.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103639.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-03T21:56:22Z"},"body":"- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11904\r\n\r\nWhen `SkeletonModifier3D` was first released, there were no modifiers that used delta, so we did not have this, but now there are some cases in `LookAtModifier3D` and `SpringBoneSimulator3D` where delta is needed.\r\n\r\nHowever, since `_process_modification()` is executed in a deferred process, it is not a suitable way to pass delta directly to it.\r\n\r\nTherefore, I added `update_delta` to a private member of `Skeleton3D`, accumulated/stored the delta there, and reset it to `0` after processing the modifiers. It allows to add `advance()` to Skeleton3D.\r\n\r\nAlso, I added a `MODIFIER_CALLBACK_MODE_PROCESS_MANUAL` mode to `Skeleton3D`, since the `CallbackModeProcess` in `AnimationMixer` and `Skeleton3D` need to match.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103639/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103639/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}